                                "sense_id": "3fb58ff7-be72-3ebd-bbd8-7c7170f10fe1",
                                "text": "The PEOPLE WITH AIDS who are the most important and needy clients of ASOs get shortchanged when education, \"program development,\" and other such Volvo-era machinations suck up needed funding and energy."
